~ start_archangel_dialogue
Archangel Raphael: [[Welcome, listener of the soul.|Greetings, creator of inner sound.]]
Archangel Raphael: This is the Sanctuary of Sound—where feelings become music and colour.
Archangel Raphael: Here, even the heaviest thoughts can be transformed into something gentle and meaningful.
Archangel Raphael: Would you like to create music from your emotions?
- Yes—let’s create something beautiful  
	=> launch_music_minigame
- Maybe later  
	=> END

~ launch_music_minigame
Archangel Raphael: *(Starts humming)*
do GameManager.request_music_minigame()
=> END

~ start_zephyr_dialogue
Everlasting Father: Hey! This is the Pop Thoughts Garden! Ready to lighten your mind?
- Yes, let’s pop some thoughts!
	=> launch_pop_thoughts
- Maybe later
	=> END

~ launch_pop_thoughts
Everlasting Father: *(Everlasting Father waves and points to the portal.)*
Everlasting Father: Loading Pop Thoughts… get ready!
do GameManager.request_pop_thoughts()
=> END

~ start_patron_pallete
Archangel Uriel: [[Hello, artist!|Greetings, creator!|Hey there!]]  
Archangel Uriel: Welcome to the Imagination Realm!
Archangel Uriel: Ready to unleash your creativity?
- Yes—let me paint!
	=> open_painting_tool
- How does it work?
	=> explain_painting_tool
- Maybe later
	=> END

~ explain_painting_tool
Archangel Uriel: In the Imagination Realm you get:  
• A full colour palette to mix any hue you like  
• Layer controls for organising your strokes  
• Undo/Redo for fearless experimentation
Archangel Uriel: Art can also travel beyond this realm. Louisa shares her artwork with the world through her own Collection.
Archangel Uriel: What would you like to do now?
- Let's dive into the Imagination Realm!
	=> open_painting_tool
- View Louisa's Collection (opens in browser)
	=> open_collection
- Return to Artéa
	=> END
	
~ open_collection
Archangel Uriel: Every creative journey begins with a single mark. Perhaps Louisa's Collection will inspire your next one.
do GameManager.request_visit_collection()
=> END

~ open_painting_tool
Archangel Uriel: Here we go—happy painting!  
do GameManager.request_paingting()
=> END

~ start_maestro_montclair
Price of Peace: [[Welcome, art lover!|Greetings, connoisseur!|Hello there!]]  
Price of Peace: You’ve arrived at the Gallery of Light. What would you like to do?
- Browse the gallery
	=> open_art_gallery
- Tell me about the gallery
	=> explain_gallery
- Maybe later
	=> END

~ explain_gallery
Price of Peace: Here you can admire the masterpieces you created in the Imagination Realm!
Price of Peace: Ready to explore?
- Yes—show me the art!
	=> open_art_gallery
- Not right now
	=> END

~ open_art_gallery
Price of Peace: Wonderful choice—let the inspiration begin!
do GameManager.request_art_gallery()
=> END


~ start_archangel_gabriel
Archangel Gabriel: [[Welcome to Artéa!|Greetings, and welcome!]]
Archangel Gabriel: I am Archangel Gabriel, the guide of Artéa — a world shaped by creativity, reflection, and emotional discovery.

Archangel Gabriel: Artéa is inspired by Louisa Chan, a Sydney-based artist and educator, and supported through Louisa Chan Creative — a practice dedicated to healing through the arts.

Archangel Gabriel: Within Artéa, you are invited to slow down, explore, and reconnect with your imagination.
=> show_menu

~ show_menu
Archangel Gabriel: Where would you like to begin?
- What can I do in Artéa?
	=> explain_artea
- About Louisa Chan
	=> open_louisa_homepage
- Start exploring Artéa
	=> explore_artea

~ explain_artea
Archangel Gabriel: Artéa is a creative space for exploration, reflection, and expression.

Archangel Gabriel: You can engage with art, interactive experiences, and tools designed to support wellbeing and creativity.

Archangel Gabriel: There is no pressure — only curiosity and expression.

Archangel Gabriel: What would you like to do next?
- Tell me about Louisa's Creative Healing Workshops
	=> open_workshops
- Go back
	=> show_menu
- Start exploring Artéa
	=> explore_artea

~ open_louisa_homepage
Archangel Gabriel: Louisa Chan is the creative visionary behind Artéa. Her work explores art, healing, and human transformation.

Archangel Gabriel: You can learn more about her journey and philosophy on her official website.

Archangel Gabriel: What would you like to do?
- Visit Louisa Chan website (opens in browser)
	=> visit_louisa_site
- Back
	=> show_menu
- Start exploring Artéa
	=> explore_artea

~ open_workshops
Archangel Gabriel: The Creative Healing Workshops are part of Louisa Chan Creative, offering guided art-based experiences for emotional expression and wellbeing.

Archangel Gabriel: These workshops blend creativity, reflection, and personal growth.

Archangel Gabriel: What would you like to do?
- View Workshops (opens in browser)
	=> visit_workshops_site
- Back
	=> show_menu
- Start exploring Artéa
	=> explore_artea
	
~ explore_artea
Archangel Gabriel: May your time in Artéa bring clarity, creativity, and calm.
=> END

~ visit_louisa_site
do GameManager.request_visit_website()
=> END

~ visit_workshops_site
do GameManager.request_visit_workshops()
=> END

~ END
Archangel Gabriel: May your time in Artéa bring clarity, creativity, and calm.